<p>Once the coast is clear, locate Doctor Mallory. You will find him quite depleted, we imagine, due to the disease that Professor Hell apparently injected into him. Administer the antidote, which you will find in the black JoyJolt 20oz Vacuum Insulated Tumbler.</p>
